{
    "version": "4.0.0.1492",
    "description": "MetaTrader 4 模板包（/portable；多账号用 bin/mt-clone.ps1）",
    "homepage": "https://www.metatrader4.com/",
    "license": {
        "identifier": "Proprietary",
        "url": "https://www.metatrader4.com/"
    },
    "url": "https://download.mql5.com/cdn/web/metaquotes.software.corp/mt4/mt4setup.exe#/mt4setup.exe",
    "installer": {
        "script": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\\\*\\\\bin\\\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/metatrader4/post_install.ps1'"
    },
    "pre_uninstall": "& ((Get-ChildItem (Join-Path $scoopdir 'buckets\\\\*\\\\bin\\\\hook.ps1') -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Select-Object -First 1).FullName) 'hooks/metatrader4/pre_uninstall.ps1'",
    "bin": [
        [
            "terminal.exe",
            "metatrader4",
            "/portable"
        ]
    ],
    "shortcuts": [
        [
            "terminal.exe",
            "MetaTrader 4",
            "/portable"
        ]
    ],
    "persist": [
        "config",
        "history",
        "logs",
        "MQL4",
        "profiles",
        "templates",
        "tester"
    ],
    "notes": [
        "快捷方式 / shim 强制 /portable；数据在 persist。",
        "安装：优先从 D:\\Program\\MetaTrader\\MetaTrader 4 种子复制（官方 /auto 仍会弹 EULA，非真静默）。",
        "多账号：& \"$env:SCOOP\\buckets\\scoop-bucket\\bin\\mt-clone.ps1\" -App metatrader4 -Name <实例名>",
        "同步程序文件：同上脚本 -SyncBinaries。卸载模板不删除 persist\\metatrader4-instances。",
        "版本半手动（未接 checkver）；官网 CDN 慢时可先 scoop install -s 跳过 hash。"
    ]
}
